    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97470" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύαρον:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν κλῶνα</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύαρτον:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βούγλωσσον</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sow</i>, in pl., Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύβαξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱκος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῦς</span>) <i>hoglike, swinish</i>, Id.: also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῠβάλλας</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύβας</span></b> , <i>ruttish,
			lustful</i>, Id.</div>
